    ]</b></color>\r\n\rBetween words, click\r\n  <color=#C56A1C><b>[ Next Word ]</b></color>\r\n\rWhen
    finished, click\r\n  <color=#8B3A1F><b>[ SEND ]</b></color>\r\n\n\r<i>Refer to
    the Morse chart below.</i>"
